#### Request ####
float32 x                   # Target x position (NED frame)
float32 y                   # Target y position (NED frame)
float32 z                   # Target z position (NED frame)
bool relative               # If true, x/y/z are offsets from current position
float32 x_threshold         # Position threshold in x (meters)
float32 y_threshold         # Position threshold in y (meters)
float32 z_threshold         # Position threshold in z (meters)
---
#### Result ####
bb_uav_msgs/GoToResult result
---
#### Feedback ####
bb_uav_msgs/GoToFeedback feedback
